# Script Extender: treaty editor (treaty = 1 in script_extender.ini). Loaded by the plugin from this
# folder; every name starts with se_ so it cannot clash with a game or mod type. Laid out on the
# Justify-war dialog (MakeCBDialog), mirrored: the terms in the wide panel, the picker in the narrow one.

